00:05:14,117 --> 00:05:20,117
The crime saga of the digital age.

2
00:10:28,235 --> 00:10:34,235
Deep Web is a documentary film directed by Alex Winter.

3
00:15:42,352 --> 00:15:48,352
Deep Web gives the inside story of one of the most important and riveting digital crime sagas of the century -- the arrest of Ross William
Ulbricht, the 30-year-old entrepreneur convicted of being 'Dread Pirate Roberts,' creator and operator of online black market Silk Road.

4
00:20:56,470 --> 00:21:02,470
As the only film with exclusive access to the Ulbricht family, Deep Web explores how the brightest minds and thought leaders behind the Deep Web and Bitcoin are now
caught in the crosshairs of the battle for control of a future inextricably linked to technology, with our digital rights hanging in the balance.

5
